WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.180
It's <i>hot!</i>

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:01.970
One, two...

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.110
It is sum-mer! Yay, so hot!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:07.270
So much sweat goes drip-drop!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.270
I'm roasting.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.820
Ami-chan, you're adorable!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:14.020
Look over here, my little mermaid!

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.890
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.120
I present to you my special tropical drinks.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.690
For your pleasure.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:23.380
Tropical!

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.620
Summer vacation is...

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.810
Such a blast!

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.560
This is such a drag.

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:32.310
Man, I totally don't get this homework!

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.640
Maybe I should work at it a bit longer.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:51.580
Episode 44
Radiance of the Heart!

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:58.240
Amu-chan, why are you going to school today?

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.820
It's not a school day.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:05.090
I have to water the flowers. It's a class duty I'm doing with Rima.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.180
You sure work hard.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:07.990
Yup.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.100
Although...

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.270
It's boiling out here.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.800
Summer just kind of snuck up on us, didn't it?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:20.930
You can say that again.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.510
It wasn't so long ago that I became a sixth-grader.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:34.010
Th-There's an e-egg in my bed!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.750
A new Guardian Character.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.070
I wonder what she'll be like.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.930
It's spring. Which means new beginnings,

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:48.390
and forcing myself to act outside of my character.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.420
And yet...

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.360
I've had it!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.260
Amu-chan, the egg!

00:03:58.310 --> 00:03:59.060
Huh?

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.590
My egg...

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.360
Has been marked with an X?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:11.280
It feels like that was so long ago now.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.530
Yeah, yeah!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.110
It really does.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.310
But it sure is...

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.470
Hot!

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.850
Right, right.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.680
I understand. Talk to you later.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.680
What did Mom say?

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:35.470
She said all of my friends are really excited that I'm going back.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.390
I see.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:41.070
I promised them. I said that after I'd finished my mission, I'd...

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:47.390
That when I was finished helping my sister with her job, I'd go back.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.390
I found you!

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.640
It's cool.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.360
I haven't made any progress on my homework.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.640
Math is really hard.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.680
I hate the Japanese assignment. I don't want to do a book report.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.680
Oh crap! I haven't read the book yet!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.390
I did.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.770
No fair, you traitor!

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.020
Quit it, Amu.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:25.020
To be this relaxed with Rima...

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.770
She was so intense in the beginning.

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.390
Meet our transfer student, Mashiro Rima-san.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:35.350
H-Have a seat.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:37.930
Thank you.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.350
{Signs: Swoon. Gloom}

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.700
Wh-What's with that? Isn't that disgusting?

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.140
But she totally screams popular.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:46.600
I'm Hinamori Amu-san. N-Nice to meet you.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:52.220
What are you smiling about? Nothing funny happened. How stupid.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.540
Let's go!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.640
Ready and...

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.350
Bala-Balance!

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:04.150
Rima!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:09.310
I'll take care of the two upper shelves, so you handle the lower ones, Mashiro-san.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:13.060
Call me Rima.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.160
Then call me Amu.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.980
What are you grinning about?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:24.480
It's a secret, I'm not telling you.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.560
That's creepy.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.630
Something's fishy.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.170
Hey, Rima!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.430
Gotcha!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.970
You should do what makes you happy.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.770
You don't want to return to the countryside, right?

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:43.640
What's the matter, Kairi?

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.890
Your Royal Cape?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.600
Jack's Chair. Fourth grade. Sanjo Kairi.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.600
I am Musashi. Salutations to all.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.970
Why are you here so late?

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.790
Anyway, why do you call me "Chairman?"

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.470
Well, you just seem like the Chairman type.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.930
Fight! Fight! Star Class!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.270
Hooray! Hooray! Moon Class!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.430
Then you take him, Chairman!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.470
What? Th-This is too unexpected!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.990
King, please take him!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.060
Huh? Me?

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.350
Here.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.930
What is this?

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.240
Your reward.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.930
I'll give you rice crackers, too!

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:24.560
Well, how about some Japanese tea I made?

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:27.370
Because you are too selfish.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.340
It's fine, it's already been decided.

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:37.970
He's here!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:42.720
Good grief, why do I have to work for you?

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.050
Don't grumble the second you walk in.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.620
It's summer vacation, so it's not like you have anything to do.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:53.020
You forget that teachers still go to work every day, even in summer.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:56.310
Ah, pardon the intrusion.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:59.640
All right, have I got some work for you!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.350
Jeez.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.500
Hey, Miki, what are you drawing?

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.850
Amulet Spade?

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:24.240
I realized that I haven't Character Transformed with you all that much.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.580
Now, that's not true, is it?

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.390
Not like I really <i>care</i> or anything.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:32.210
I Character Transform all the time!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:36.470
S-Speaking of which, everyone can Character Transform now!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.390
T-That's right!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.140
My heart:

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.670
Unlock!

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:52.600
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.850
Holy Crown!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:58.020
That's our Tadase-kun, all frilly and sparkly!

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:00.630
I think he finds it a bit embarrassing, though.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.020
I think it is splendid!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.370
My heart:

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.570
Unlock!

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.390
Dechu!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.640
Come on, Pepe-chan!

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:12.850
Right-dechu!

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:22.850
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.930
Yaya Character Transforms into a baby, unsurprisingly.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.170
And her secret weapons are all baby items!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.770
Merry Merry!

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.350
My heart:

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:32.700
Unlock!

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.390
Character Transformation: Samurai Soul!

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:44.140
This is who Kairi-kun would like to be?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.430
It's super cool, of course!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:50.310
Secret Technique: Thunder Blade!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.000
My heart:

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.600
Unlock!

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:11.310
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:14.060
Rima's specializes in clown techniques.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.970
She is small and cute, but super duper strong.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.390
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.570
Wait! Why did I Character Transform?

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.360
Was my heart unlocked, too?

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.360
Kukai was just too shocked!

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:38.510
Well, it did happen rather suddenly.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.690
I want to see Daichi again.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:49.180
Now that everyone can Character Transform, your position as the heroine might be in danger.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.680
But she can Character Transform with all kinds of different Guardian Characters!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:56.160
Amu-chan's Heart: Unlock!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.060
Character Transformation: Amulet Angel!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.060
Character Transformation: Amulet Devil!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.680
Devil's Tune!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.850
Character Transformation: Amulet Diamond!

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:43.490
Am I the one in danger, since I Character Transform less and less?

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:45.140
Now now...

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.100
Ah, there they are.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:52.270
It's past the time we arranged to meet, you two.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.350
Oops!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.730
Let's go, Rima!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:55.650
Right.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.450
Come on, Miki!

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:58.620
Fine.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:16.100
Feast your eyes on our brand new office! It's my castle!

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:22.310
With Utau's songs and my hard work, a new wave will overtake the entertainment industry! Wait and see!

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:25.040
<i>And</i> with me helping you move.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:27.010
I'm just being economical!

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.290
Setting up this office wiped my bank account dry.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.350
I'm really sorry about this, Sensei.

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:38.130
Hey, be careful with those!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.030
Put those boxes over there, will you?

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.680
Don't order me around just because you don't have any money.

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.060
I'm not your boyfriend anymore, either, you know.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.090
Quit your yapping.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:52.070
We might not be dating anymore, but I can still put you to good use.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:57.360
By the way, why aren't you carrying anything?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.990
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:02.490
Because I'm the President!

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.970
Silly. Be more careful, would you?

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.600
Sure.

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:19.840
Now that's what I call a good mood. A love prediction flag has been raised!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:22.600
And I thought everything was back to normal. Color me shocked.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.140
Chairman!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.860
Hey!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.460
Hiya!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.580
Why are you all here?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:42.190
Nikaidou-sensei called us.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:45.270
Your sister is setting up a new office, right?

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.890
We're here to help with the move.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.390
Hey there, if it isn't Amu-chan!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.500
El!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.810
Long time no see! You doing well?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:58.250
Yes! Even Il has been acting nice and-

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.240
Gimme!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.450
Ah! What are you doing?

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.880
They never change.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.220
Wait a minute.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.510
What are you talking about?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.770
I don't recall asking for your help.

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.560
Don't worry, I don't plan to help <i>you</i>.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:15.830
I came here for <i>Kairi</i>.

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.770
Wait, you two.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.080
Just a second.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.900
Utau-chan's not being honest about her feelings. She's actually glad you're here.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.720
Huh? What are you saying?

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.500
How about showing a little gratitude, then?

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.120
Are you dense? Don't take El's nonsense seriously.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.480
You are <i>so</i> not cute.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:37.970
Like you can talk.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.360
How typical of them.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.670
Whenever they're together...

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.310
They always argue.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.350
What's wrong, Amu?

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.680
You want Dia, don't you? Then fight me!

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:51.580
But I don't want to fight!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.180
What do <i>you</i> know?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:04.180
How could someone who does everything halfway, like you, possibly understand my suffering and sadness?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:09.100
I won't fight you! Because I like you, Utau!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:15.850
Well, I guess you can say this is their way of getting along.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:19.810
For your information, I didn't think you'd stoop this low.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.420
I'm not stooping!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.100
No matter how nice you are, I'm not giving Ikuto to you.

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:26.640
That again?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.620
Listen, Ikuto and I are...

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:30.710
Not really...

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:34.020
After we went on a date to the amusement park at night...  {this might not be right}

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.810
What were you just remembering?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.090
N-Nothing!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.140
Sketchy.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.910
I said it was nothing!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.910
Uh, um...

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.100
You're hiding something!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.430
We came to help them move, right?

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.680
No, I'm not!

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.600
That was the idea.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.600
You're breaking out in a sweat!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:16:00.600
Now then, let's toast to the bright future of Sanjo Productions!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.030
Cheers!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.720
Cheers!

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:07.550
Sanjo Productions? What a lame name.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:10.430
I've no desire to get in the way of that ego, thank you.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.880
Here you go.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.310
I am in your debt.

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:22.190
Impressive, Yaya.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.150
Joker.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:25.720
Hello?

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.620
What's wrong, Chairman? Something on your mind?

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:32.140
N-No, nothing.

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:37.910
I'm glad to hear it. But if something comes up, you shouldn't force yourself to deal with it alone.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.430
You have all of the Guardians. They're always saving me.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.560
Joker.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.130
I will be your opponent from here on,

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.270
Joker!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.740
I still believe in you.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.140
I don't care if that's simpleminded or stupid.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.720
You're still spouting this nonse-

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.870
Kairi...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:58.990
Because the Kairi that we knew is the real you!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:06.060
The Chairman's staring at Amu-chi again!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.550
No, I wasn't... I...

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.680
Just admit it, you were staring.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.810
Yes.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:15.810
Kairi, don't you have something to tell them?

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:20.810
What is it, Chairman?

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:26.810
To be honest, the office isn't all that's moving.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:31.310
I am as well. I've decided to go back to my hometown.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:35.060
Your hometown? Isn't that in...

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:36.830
Yamaguchi.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:39.410
You're kidding, right, Chairman?

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.110
Is that true?

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:51.920
Yukari-neesan has left Easter, so I have no reason to be at Seiyo Elementary anymore.

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.690
But to just up and leave...

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.720
Yeah, this is just too sudden!

00:17:56.560 --> 00:18:02.080
My parents and my former classmates all want me to hurry back.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.740
I was the class representative at my old elementary school.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.200
But we need you, too, Kairi.

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:11.930
That's right, and the Guardians are finally all settled.

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:15.920
The bonds we've formed are indeed solid.

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.770
Don't you agree?

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:21.850
Let's go, all of you! {Not sure about this one}

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:23.570
My heart:

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:24.950
My heart:

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.090
My heart:

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.770
My heart:

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.220
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:53.930
Even without me here, the ties that bind the Guardians will not unravel.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.310
That's still no excuse for you to leave!

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:02.550
Joker, I've taken the words you said to heart.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:03.610
Huh?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:07.310
The words you said to Dia.

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:13.220
I believe! I believe in the radiance inside of me! {check}

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:19.060
At Seiyo Elementary, all I did was lie to myself.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:22.120
I'm still immature in many ways.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:27.460
And if I'm going to regain the ability to believe in myself,

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:31.560
I must return to my hometown, and devote myself to starting over.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:37.450
It sounds like this is something that's very important to you.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.790
So that you can be who you truly are.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.470
I understand.

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:49.430
Do your best, Chairman!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.140
I will.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.690
Will you be all right, Sister?

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:01.680
Please stay mindful of keeping a balanced diet.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:05.310
Don't eat out all the time just because I'm not there to cook.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:08.000
And don't forget the cleaning, or the laundry.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:10.040
Don't let it pile up.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:14.060
Oh hush, you two. Just get going.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.430
Goodness, what a troublesome sister.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:23.100
Kairi! Stay strong! Work hard!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:28.050
Thank you for coming all the way out here to see me off.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.220
Stay strong.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.640
We'll write, okay?

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:33.700
We'll miss you, Sanjo-kun.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.210
Thanks for everything. I wish the King well.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:38.880
Now...

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:41.720
I'll be going first.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.390
Huh?

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.080
Joker.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:49.620
I love you, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:58.560
I love you now, and I always will, until the end of time.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:07.470
One day, when I become a man worthy of you, I will definitely come back.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:16.410
So now you know. I won't let you beat me.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.070
Huh? Uh, sure.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.850
Hey, say something!

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:21.860
Amu-chi's freaking out!

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.970
This is the first time anyone's confessed to me!

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.570
My oh my, shouldn't a girl say something cool now?

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:30.730
Maybe so, but...

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.350
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:34.750
Kairi, we must be off.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:35.740
Right.

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:38.640
Kairi!

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:42.850
Thanks! We'll see each other again, for sure!

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:08.970
It was only for a short time, but we definitely made some good friends, didn't we?

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.280
Yeah.

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:52.310
Been a while, hasn't it?

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:53.420
Yup, in a way.

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:54.950
It sure does.

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:57.710
Yeah, I think so. Hey, what are we talking about?

00:23:57.780 --> 00:24:01.730
Seichiro, Seichiro. He's really going for it this time.

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:04.320
Oh, Seichiro. Wait, who's that?

00:24:04.560 --> 00:24:06.800
You really have to admire his spirit, don't you?

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:10.440
You are really cool in the end, Seichiro-san.

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.000
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:13.890
Go for it! Seichiro!

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:17.780
Yay, yay, Seichiro! Go, go, Seichiro!

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:19.770
Seriously, who the heck is Seichiro?!
